OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787163531
OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,FBritish sprinters Amy Hunt and Dina
OL,7,FAsher-Smith have made history at the
OL,8,FEuropean Athletics Championships in
OL,9,FBirmingham after gaining a gold medal
OL,10,Fin the inaugural mixed 4x100m relay
OL,11,Ffinal.
OL,13,FHunt became the first athlete to win
OL,14,Ffour gold medals at a single European
OL,15,FChampionships on Sunday, having
OL,16,Falready won gold in the women's 4x100m
OL,17,Frelay, the 100m, and 200m.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
