FL,312,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787163531
OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,FIt was Asher-Smith's 11th medal,
OL,7,Fmaking her the most decorated European
OL,8,FAthletics Championship athlete of all
OL,9,Ftime.
OL,11,FThe pair won the relay alongside
OL,12,FZharnel Hughes and Jeremiah Azu,
OL,13,Fbeating Germany and Spain in 39.97s.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
