FL,312,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787163531
OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,F"Oh my gosh, (I feel) just
OL,7,Fsensational! I think it surpassed my
OL,8,Fexpectations for myself at this
OL,9,Fchamps, not in terms of just the
OL,10,Fgolds, but how I've handled myself,
OL,11,Fhow I've handled all the pressure, the
OL,12,Fattention, the recovery, the
OL,13,Fdiscipline of it all," Hunt said after
OL,14,Fthe win.
OL,16,F"Not getting too caught up in the
OL,17,Fhighs and staying kind of true to
OL,18,Fmyself, keeping humble and keeping my
OL,19,Ffoot on the gas the whole way through
OL,20,Fthe week. Seven races in seven days is
OL,21,Fno easy feat."
