OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787163531
OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,FAsher-Smith joined Polish sprinter
OL,7,FIrena Szewinska on 10 European medals
OL,8,Fwith women's 4100 relay triumph on
OL,9,FSaturday after also collecting 200m
OL,10,Fbronze earlier in the week, although
OL,11,Fshe already had two more golds to her
OL,12,Fname.
OL,14,FWith Sunday's addition, the British
OL,15,Frecord-holder is now up to eight
OL,16,FEuropean golds, and is the lone
OL,17,Fathlete with 11 medals overall.
OL,26,@pD@OOZ
