SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787163531
OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,F"It hasn't sunk in at all," Asher-
OL,7,FSmith said, when asked about her
OL,8,Fachievement. "At this point in my
OL,9,Fcareer, I'm just having fun.
OL,11,F"I'm just seeing what can be maxed out
OL,12,Fbecause I'm fortunate enough to stand
OL,13,Fon the line, and I don't really have
OL,14,Fmuch to prove. I'd like an Olympic
OL,15,Fgold, but that's kind of the only
OL,16,Fthing that's on my bucket list.
OL,18,F"Being able to kind of come here and
OL,19,Fjust kind of have fun and do some more
OL,20,Fevents is a privilege. It's definitely
OL,21,Fa privilege."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
