OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,FA silver for Matt Hudson-Smith in the
OL,7,Fmen's 4x400m relay brought his total
OL,8,Fto nine, making him the outright most-
OL,9,Fdecorated man in the history of the
OL,10,FEuropean Championships.
OL,12,FThere was also gold for Georgia Hunter
OL,13,FBell in the 1500m final.
OL,15,FThe mixed 4100 relay made its
OL,16,FEuropean Championships debut in
OL,17,FBirmingham, opening the possibility
OL,18,Ffor the ambitious Hunt to set her
OL,19,Fsights on four titles on home soil
OL,20,Fafter clinching a sprint double, then
OL,21,Fwomen's 4x100m gold.
OL,26,@wD@LOZ
