OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,FHunt and Asher-Smith confirmed that
OL,7,Fthey were not unduly affected by
OL,8,Fsecurity measures at the venue on
OL,9,FSaturday night, as all of the teams in
OL,10,Fthat evening session's two relays were
OL,11,Funable to leave on time following a
OL,12,Fpolice incident.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
