PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787163531
OL,3,CAmy Hunt becomes first athlete to win
OL,4,Cfour golds at European Championships
OL,6,FThe women's 4x400m relay quartet of
OL,7,FYemi Mary-John, Lina Nielsen, Nicole
OL,8,FYeargin and Emily Newnham struck
OL,9,Fsilver, while their men's
OL,10,Fcounterparts, Hudson-Smith, Toby
OL,11,FHarries, Ben Jeffries and Dobson
OL,12,Ffinished three one hundredths of a
OL,13,Fsecond behind Italy in the
OL,14,Fcompetition's closing race.
OL,16,FJazmin Sawyers also snatched silver in
OL,17,Fthe long jump, and Abbie Donnelly
OL,18,Fbecame the first British woman to win
OL,19,Fa marathon medal at the European
OL,20,FChampionships, with bronze.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/8
